 alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AZV6lTm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Yc3s8na.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iqjbhOr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sy21BTe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4uSaqGJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AEX6ikk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hK2Ne4q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OofG9DM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Merge Enchantments 是一款模组，允许你混合、排除甚至组合附魔。示例包括：锋利、击倒、节肢杀手，所有类型的保护（火焰、爆炸、弹射物），精准采集与时运，激流与引雷/忠诚，密度、穿透、击倒与节肢杀手。请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki\">Wiki</a> 了解配置文件的使用方法，你可以在其中设置 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">黑名单</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Merge-Enchantments/wiki/Config#blacklist\">组合所有附魔</a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/H9nhuOr.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"233\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/l717aDK.gif\" width=\"414\" height=\"234\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>常见问题解答 (FAQ)</strong></span></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：它支持其他模组的附魔吗？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：自 3.0 版本起，即可合并所有原版及外部模组的附魔。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：如何同时获得 <span style=\"color: #008000;\">精准采集</span> 和 <span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">时运</span>？</strong><br />答：你需要安装 Merge Enchantments 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toggle-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Toggle Enchantments<br /></a><strong>问：如何使 <span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">激流</span> 同时拥有 <span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">忠诚</span> 和 <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">引雷</span>？</strong><br />答：你需要安装 Merge Enchantments 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-trident-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Improved Trident Enchantments</a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：我可以将 Merge Enchantments 包含在我的整合包中吗？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：当然可以，只需在相关项目中提及我的模组即可。</span></li>\n</ul>",
